WEBVTT

00:01.355 --> 00:03.574
AI CV Studio: Keep every job in one place.

00:03.574 --> 00:07.350
Open the Job tracker

00:07.350 --> 00:11.309
Add a job: title, company and the advert

00:11.309 --> 00:15.342
Save it. It lands in Saved

00:15.342 --> 00:19.778
Drag it on as you hear back, or open Actions

00:19.778 --> 00:22.588
Free to start: Never lose track again.
